# wide-pitch: from the menu, load the saved game the items session writes; look as far down as
# the pitch goes (past the original's limit), turn a full circle and walk on; then the same looking
# all the way up. Turning and walking at a steep pitch is where the view ahead alone leaves holes
# (enhcheck.py holes)
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
10000 down 1
13000 down d           # turn right
21000 up d
21500 down w           # walk on
27000 up w
27500 up 1
28000 down 3
31000 down a           # turn left
39000 up a
39500 down w
45000 up w
45500 up 3
